            "review_text": "Thi Thuy Linh T\n1 contribution\n0\nSooo goodddd\nOct 2025 • Family\nI had a wonderful experience at this Vietnamese restaurant! The space is beautifully designed — cozy, elegant, and full of character. The food was absolutely delicious, full of authentic flavors and beautifully presented. Prices are very reasonable for the quality you get. Highly recommend this place if you’re looking for great Vietnamese cuisine in a lovely setting\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 22, 2025",
